WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:37.880
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:38.150 --> 01:44.009
[Small Town Remedy]

3
01:44.150 --> 01:46.720
[Episode 23]

4
01:48.120 --> 01:50.520
I've seen people steal wallets and phones,

5
01:50.560 --> 01:52.000
but never a seal.

6
01:53.150 --> 01:54.070
Sir,

7
01:54.350 --> 01:55.310
I didn't steal it.

8
01:55.310 --> 01:56.920
It asked me to save it.

9
01:58.150 --> 01:59.880
So someone else is behind this.

10
02:01.070 --> 02:01.930
Who do you mean?

11
02:02.280 --> 02:03.000
Yaya.

12
02:03.150 --> 02:04.070
Say no more!

13
02:05.150 --> 02:06.040
Sir,

14
02:06.150 --> 02:07.950
my dad was referring to the seal.

15
02:08.280 --> 02:10.120
He named the seal Yaya.

16
02:12.240 --> 02:13.400
Are you two, father and daughter,

17
02:13.400 --> 02:15.200
on this together and fooling me?

18
02:17.280 --> 02:18.079
Um,

19
02:18.240 --> 02:20.280
I-I want to show you something.

20
02:20.360 --> 02:22.430
Could you come out with me for a second?

21
02:22.430 --> 02:23.280
Please.

22
02:24.380 --> 02:31.050
[This area is under video surveillance.]

23
02:26.710 --> 02:27.680
Sir,

24
02:28.000 --> 02:28.800
well,

25
02:28.800 --> 02:29.400
I am

26
02:29.400 --> 02:31.280
a doctor at Xiaoximen Hospital.

27
02:31.280 --> 02:31.910
My dad

28
02:31.910 --> 02:33.470
has a mental illness.

29
02:33.680 --> 02:34.190
He is...

30
02:34.870 --> 02:36.240
not quite right here.

31
02:36.800 --> 02:38.310
Let me show you his...

32
02:38.590 --> 02:39.680
This is his

33
02:39.680 --> 02:41.140
psychiatric evaluation.

34
02:41.630 --> 02:43.360
Why didn't you tell us earlier?

35
02:44.840 --> 02:45.630
I

36
02:46.030 --> 02:46.800
was afraid you would

37
02:46.800 --> 02:48.460
send him to a mental hospital.

38
02:51.470 --> 02:52.280
I...

39
02:52.520 --> 02:54.710
My dad has been on medication continuously.

40
02:54.710 --> 02:56.520
He has no history of violence.

41
02:56.910 --> 02:58.400
I can take good care of him.

42
03:00.030 --> 03:00.840
My...

43
03:01.710 --> 03:03.310
My dad is too kind-hearted.

44
03:03.520 --> 03:04.630
He just

45
03:05.030 --> 03:06.430
wanted to save that seal.

46
03:07.280 --> 03:08.360
I... I don't know

47
03:08.360 --> 03:09.470
how he used that tricycle

48
03:09.470 --> 03:10.910
to haul it out either.

49
03:11.400 --> 03:13.400
But he really didn't do it for money.

50
03:13.800 --> 03:15.310
I-I can guarantee t-this.

51
03:15.430 --> 03:17.360
We don't have the channels either.

52
03:18.680 --> 03:20.540
Your father has a mental illness,

53
03:20.590 --> 03:21.990
but you are of sound mind.

54
03:22.470 --> 03:24.280
It's your duty to keep him in check.

55
03:24.280 --> 03:26.480
Otherwise, if he stole a seal this time,

56
03:26.630 --> 03:27.829
what about next time?

57
03:28.150 --> 03:29.910
What if he steals something else next time?

58
03:29.910 --> 03:30.710
Exactly.

59
03:30.800 --> 03:31.560
Sir, sorry

60
03:31.560 --> 03:32.710
for all the trouble we've caused you.

61
03:32.710 --> 03:34.640
The point is not the trouble for me.

62
03:35.360 --> 03:37.360
If your father does this again,

63
03:37.630 --> 03:39.630
even showing the evaluation won't help.

64
03:39.630 --> 03:41.690
We must send him to a mental hospital.

65
03:42.030 --> 03:43.280
There won't be a next time.

66
03:43.280 --> 03:45.140
I promise I will keep him in check.

67
03:45.280 --> 03:46.360
I don't like

68
03:46.360 --> 03:47.420
that Officer Song.

69
03:48.030 --> 03:49.079
He's so serious.

70
03:49.470 --> 03:50.590
Given the way he was,

71
03:50.590 --> 03:51.400
you were still

72
03:52.520 --> 03:54.030
bowing and scraping to him.

73
03:54.030 --> 03:55.000
My rank is much higher

74
03:55.000 --> 03:56.030
than his!

75
03:56.190 --> 03:57.310
I'm wondering

76
03:57.310 --> 03:59.310
where they put that seal.

77
03:59.800 --> 04:01.200
I can receive the signal.

78
04:01.840 --> 04:03.100
Let me check the signal

79
04:03.910 --> 04:05.360
to see where they put it.

80
04:06.470 --> 04:07.280
No way.

81
04:08.150 --> 04:09.350
I've got to go find it.

82
04:09.470 --> 04:10.030
It's...

83
04:10.030 --> 04:10.680
Dad!

84
04:11.190 --> 04:12.790
Can you stop messing around?

85
04:13.190 --> 04:14.030
You pity the seal.

86
04:14.030 --> 04:15.710
Can you pity me, too?

87
04:16.040 --> 04:17.040
Me!

88
04:18.040 --> 04:19.160
Look at me!

89
04:19.160 --> 04:20.870
Look at me, Dad!

90
04:21.680 --> 04:22.720
I've been cleaning up

91
04:22.720 --> 04:24.480
your messes since I was a kid!

92
04:24.630 --> 04:25.560
Officer Song told me

93
04:25.560 --> 04:26.950
to keep a close eye on you.

94
04:26.950 --> 04:27.750
He said if...

95
04:27.750 --> 04:28.800
if this happens again,

96
04:28.800 --> 04:30.730
he'd send you to a mental hospital.

97
04:31.390 --> 04:32.650
Do you want to go there?

98
04:33.000 --> 04:34.600
How else can I watch you?

99
04:34.600 --> 04:36.070
How do you expect me to watch you?

100
04:36.070 --> 04:36.870
Tell me!

101
04:37.800 --> 04:38.870
Every day, all I do is work

102
04:38.870 --> 04:40.070
and keep an eye on you.

103
04:40.240 --> 04:41.600
I still want to get my PhD!

104
04:41.600 --> 04:42.920
I want to get out of this place!

105
04:42.920 --> 04:44.159
But can I?

106
04:44.310 --> 04:44.800
As if

107
04:44.800 --> 04:45.950
getting out of this place

108
04:45.950 --> 04:47.950
c-could change my life!

109
04:49.120 --> 04:50.430
Sober up a bit,

110
04:50.430 --> 04:51.480
will you?

111
04:55.270 --> 04:56.070
Was I...

112
04:56.480 --> 04:57.680
Was I born into the wrong family?

113
04:57.680 --> 04:58.630
Why did I have

114
04:58.630 --> 04:59.800
to get such a fate

115
04:59.800 --> 05:01.270
and such a dad?

116
05:02.720 --> 05:04.680
Tell me why...

117
05:05.270 --> 05:06.190
Why?

118
06:29.440 --> 06:33.310
[Sitong Cold Storage]

119
06:32.430 --> 06:33.240
San,

120
06:33.240 --> 06:33.950
does it have to get

121
06:33.950 --> 06:35.510
your whole family involved?

122
06:35.510 --> 06:36.159
Yes, of course.

123
06:36.159 --> 06:36.870
Zhengliang,

124
06:36.870 --> 06:38.560
we are here to cheer for you.

125
06:39.270 --> 06:40.159
Go for it, brother-in-law!

126
06:40.159 --> 06:40.870
You got this!

127
06:40.870 --> 06:41.360
Hey...

128
06:41.680 --> 06:43.360
It's not appropriate to call me that, is it?

129
06:43.360 --> 06:44.190
Who are you

130
06:44.190 --> 06:45.920
to decide what others call you?

131
06:49.800 --> 06:51.430
How many of you are going in?

132
06:51.560 --> 06:52.390
The two of us.

133
06:52.430 --> 06:53.240
Just me.

134
06:54.240 --> 06:55.040
That won't do.

135
06:55.040 --> 06:56.750
What if you fall over or get hurt?

136
06:56.750 --> 06:57.950
How can I not worry?

137
06:59.630 --> 07:00.560
I'll go with you.

138
07:00.870 --> 07:01.680
Okay.

139
07:02.190 --> 07:02.830
Any number

140
07:02.830 --> 07:04.000
of you can go in.

141
07:04.920 --> 07:06.360
As San instructed,

142
07:06.390 --> 07:08.390
the ground is covered with 3 layers of ice

143
07:08.390 --> 07:09.510
and is very slippery. So be careful.

144
07:09.510 --> 07:10.360
Got it.

145
07:10.140 --> 07:11.930
[Cold Storage Work Notice]

146
07:36.630 --> 07:37.430
Wait a minute!

147
07:38.830 --> 07:40.090
I'll make a call first.

148
07:40.159 --> 07:41.159
Let me make a call.

149
07:41.680 --> 07:42.190
Okay.

150
08:00.920 --> 08:01.520
What's up?

151
08:02.270 --> 08:02.800
Hello.

152
08:03.870 --> 08:04.680
Well,

153
08:05.510 --> 08:07.110
how are you doing in Beijing?

154
08:07.430 --> 08:08.830
I've been doing great lately.

155
08:08.830 --> 08:09.960
Beijing is awesome.

156
08:10.360 --> 08:11.390
My monthly salary is even

157
08:11.390 --> 08:12.450
higher than yours.

158
08:13.560 --> 08:15.040
Xiaoximen Hospital is already closed.

159
08:15.040 --> 08:16.840
Of course you earn more than I do.

160
08:17.870 --> 08:19.390
What made you suddenly

161
08:19.390 --> 08:20.390
call me?

162
08:22.510 --> 08:23.270
Nothing.

163
08:23.630 --> 08:24.960
I just called casually.

164
08:27.000 --> 08:28.400
How have you been lately?

165
08:28.430 --> 08:29.240
Pretty well?

166
08:30.560 --> 08:31.360
Just okay.

167
08:32.200 --> 08:33.669
That's good enough.

168
08:34.120 --> 08:36.580
You are not going to have a great life anyway.

169
08:41.320 --> 08:42.120
Zhengguang,

170
08:43.150 --> 08:44.000
if find it tough

171
08:44.000 --> 08:46.060
over there, you can always come back.

172
08:47.080 --> 08:48.680
I'm not leaving this winter.

173
08:54.030 --> 08:55.510
Can I take your word for it?

174
08:59.000 --> 09:00.130
I've made up my mind.

175
09:00.320 --> 09:02.580
Even if I die, I want to die in my hometown.

176
09:02.960 --> 09:03.720
Can you

177
09:03.720 --> 09:05.320
please stop jinxing it?

178
09:05.440 --> 09:06.360
Didn't Mom say

179
09:06.360 --> 09:07.480
your illness was nothing serious?

180
09:07.480 --> 09:08.390
Don't think too much.

181
09:08.390 --> 09:09.270
It won't kill you.

182
09:09.270 --> 09:10.200
Liu Zhengguang!

183
09:10.580 --> 09:19.950
[Problem Parcel Handling Area]

184
09:12.320 --> 09:13.870
We hired you to work,

185
09:13.870 --> 09:14.550
not to chit-chat

186
09:14.550 --> 09:15.880
on the phone for so long.

187
09:16.550 --> 09:17.240
Yes,

188
09:17.360 --> 09:19.220
I'll deliver it to you right away.

189
09:19.390 --> 09:20.670
It's an urgent delivery for a customer, Manager.

190
09:19.990 --> 09:21.670
[Dumb Liu]

191
09:21.200 --> 09:23.600
Which customer is called Dumb Liu?

192
09:23.620 --> 09:24.850
[Linmon Express Safety Risk Grading & Control Checklist]

193
09:26.550 --> 09:28.550
Don't let him get sick from the cold.

194
11:08.240 --> 11:09.670
How are you feeling now?

195
11:12.320 --> 11:13.440
Is it working?

196
11:15.200 --> 11:16.330
It's freezing cold.

197
12:29.670 --> 12:30.510
Zhengliang.

198
12:32.670 --> 12:33.800
Go back to the South.

199
12:34.670 --> 12:36.670
Don't make yourself suffer so much.

200
12:39.030 --> 12:40.830
I don't want to run away anymore.

201
12:41.720 --> 12:43.520
What's wrong with running away?

202
12:44.870 --> 12:45.910
As long as you're healthy

203
12:45.910 --> 12:47.710
and living well, that's enough.

204
12:51.440 --> 12:52.240
Why?

205
12:53.550 --> 12:54.390
Why do you always want

206
12:54.390 --> 12:55.390
to send me away?

207
12:57.320 --> 12:58.080
You did this back then,

208
12:58.080 --> 12:59.740
and you're still doing it now.

209
14:09.990 --> 14:12.370
[Fucheng Funeral Services Street]

210
14:12.420 --> 14:14.630
[Xiao'an Paper Offerings Shop]

211
14:33.320 --> 14:34.120
Girl.

212
14:35.790 --> 14:36.720
There's a big job

213
14:36.720 --> 14:38.320
worth 18,000 yuan tomorrow.

214
14:39.120 --> 14:40.600
Order 2,500 yuan's worth of flowers,

215
14:40.600 --> 14:41.720
and work with Xiaozhu tonight

216
14:41.720 --> 14:43.250
to set up the mourning hall.

217
14:43.960 --> 14:45.840
I don't have time for the next few days.

218
14:45.840 --> 14:47.510
Liu Zhengliang is having a fever, with no one else

219
14:47.510 --> 14:48.240
looking after him.

220
14:48.240 --> 14:49.480
I've got to take care of him.

221
14:49.480 --> 14:50.600
Just let Xiaozhu

222
14:50.600 --> 14:52.000
handle it. Won't that do?

223
14:53.510 --> 14:54.510
It's just a fever.

224
14:57.720 --> 14:59.320
Will the earth stop turning?

225
14:59.630 --> 15:00.760
We still need to work

226
15:01.000 --> 15:02.200
and earn money.

227
15:02.360 --> 15:03.600
He's been having a fever

228
15:03.600 --> 15:05.510
since his return from the cold storage.

229
15:05.510 --> 15:06.770
Of course I'm worried.

230
15:07.790 --> 15:09.360
He's a doctor himself.

231
15:09.440 --> 15:10.970
What are you worried about?

232
15:11.790 --> 15:13.360
He's good at treating others,

233
15:13.360 --> 15:15.550
but when it comes to himself, he's useless.

234
15:15.550 --> 15:16.600
What a poor thing.

235
15:22.750 --> 15:23.550
Why don't you

236
15:24.320 --> 15:26.000
call Zhengguang and ask

237
15:26.720 --> 15:27.870
if this has

238
15:28.390 --> 15:29.750
ever happened before?

239
15:32.720 --> 15:33.510
Okay.

240
15:34.320 --> 15:35.120
I'll...

241
15:35.270 --> 15:36.470
I'll call him and see.

242
15:40.790 --> 15:41.600
Hello?

243
15:42.200 --> 15:43.460
Delivery for Room 201.

244
15:44.550 --> 15:46.010
Leave it at the door? Okay.

245
15:46.550 --> 15:47.240
No problem.

246
15:57.030 --> 15:58.240
Chen, what's up?

247
16:01.360 --> 16:02.120
He's sick?

248
16:03.870 --> 16:04.600
I don't know.

249
16:04.600 --> 16:05.330
I don't think

250
16:05.600 --> 16:06.720
it has happened before.

251
16:06.720 --> 16:07.910
He didn't come back often.

252
16:07.910 --> 16:10.040
I don't recall this happening before.

253
16:11.750 --> 16:12.550
Okay.

254
16:14.150 --> 16:14.750
Alright.

255
16:18.720 --> 16:19.440
Come in.

256
16:21.630 --> 16:22.440
Manager.

257
16:24.150 --> 16:25.150
What is it?

258
16:27.150 --> 16:28.680
I'd like to ask for 3 days off

259
16:29.030 --> 16:30.430
to go back to my hometown.

260
16:34.670 --> 16:35.870
What for?

261
16:36.120 --> 16:37.270
My brother is sick.

262
16:37.670 --> 16:39.600
I want to go back and check in on him.

263
16:40.480 --> 16:41.280
What illness?

264
16:43.360 --> 16:45.870
It's quite complicated.

265
16:46.120 --> 16:46.670
I can't really

266
16:46.670 --> 16:47.480
explain it clearly right now,

267
16:47.480 --> 16:48.870
but it's quite serious.

268
16:49.440 --> 16:50.960
Okay, you may go back.

269
16:51.840 --> 16:52.970
Thank you, Manager.

270
16:53.480 --> 16:54.600
We will pay you

271
16:54.840 --> 16:56.640
for this month before you leave,

272
16:56.750 --> 16:58.790
and you don't need to come back.

273
17:03.270 --> 17:03.910
What do you mean, Manager?

274
17:03.910 --> 17:05.040
I don't quite get it.

275
17:05.920 --> 17:07.240
Am I not making myself

276
17:07.440 --> 17:08.680
clear enough?

277
17:11.240 --> 17:12.240
Manager Wu wasn't

278
17:12.310 --> 17:13.240
making it hard for you specifically.

279
17:13.210 --> 17:20.540
[Dumplings]

280
17:14.000 --> 17:15.790
He treats every one of us the same way.

281
17:15.790 --> 17:17.160
I've been working here for 3 years.

282
17:17.160 --> 17:18.510
I've only taken 1 day off.

283
17:18.510 --> 17:20.270
You've only been here for a few months,

284
17:20.270 --> 17:21.930
and you want to take 3 days off.

285
17:22.030 --> 17:23.030
No way.

286
17:25.270 --> 17:26.240
But mine should be

287
17:26.240 --> 17:27.440
considered an exemption.

288
17:27.440 --> 17:28.500
My brother is sick.

289
17:28.510 --> 17:30.310
What's the use of you going back?

290
17:30.400 --> 17:32.110
You might as well make more money

291
17:32.110 --> 17:33.710
to transfer to your brother.

292
17:35.550 --> 17:37.110
I don't even have enough for myself.

293
17:37.110 --> 17:38.310
How can I transfer it?

294
17:40.680 --> 17:42.740
I don't know what else I can say to you.

295
17:46.350 --> 17:47.510
Just think about it.

296
17:47.680 --> 17:49.140
I'm going to the restroom.

297
18:00.540 --> 18:03.300
[Dumb Liu]

298
18:37.000 --> 18:38.590
Why haven't you been pushing me

299
18:38.590 --> 18:40.450
to snap the rubber band recently?

300
18:42.200 --> 18:43.270
I gave up!

301
18:44.480 --> 18:46.240
You gave up so easily?

302
18:46.750 --> 18:48.400
Why don't you learn from those two?

303
18:48.400 --> 18:49.460
I can't learn that.

304
18:50.590 --> 18:52.030
The two of them treat each other

305
18:52.030 --> 18:53.240
as equals.

306
18:54.640 --> 18:55.640
And you are...

307
18:56.590 --> 18:57.400
my leader.

308
18:58.070 --> 19:00.000
I dare not speak up.

309
19:02.310 --> 19:03.310
Where's the disc?

310
19:04.200 --> 19:06.270
I didn't see it in the machine.

311
19:13.400 --> 19:14.660
You've figured it out?

312
19:17.030 --> 19:18.030
What do you mean?

313
19:18.030 --> 19:18.960
To get treated.

314
19:19.030 --> 19:19.880
I'm not sick.

315
19:23.240 --> 19:25.680
Then why are you looking for the disc?

316
19:25.720 --> 19:27.240
Can't I just give it a try?

317
19:27.440 --> 19:29.100
You want to destroy it, right?

318
19:30.030 --> 19:32.160
I'm doing it for our daughter, Ai Chen.

319
19:34.070 --> 19:35.070
This is all very normal.

320
19:35.070 --> 19:36.530
You need to exercise more.

321
19:37.200 --> 19:38.640
Yeah, yeah, you have to keep it up.

322
19:38.640 --> 19:39.270
Exercise a bit,

323
19:39.270 --> 19:40.550
but don't overdo it.

324
19:40.790 --> 19:42.110
Adjust your diet, too.

325
19:42.350 --> 19:43.070
Like oil.

326
19:43.070 --> 19:44.480
Too much oil and salt is not good.

327
19:44.030 --> 19:47.590
[Medical Consultation] [Free]

328
19:44.790 --> 19:45.680
Okay, bye.

329
19:47.750 --> 19:49.160
[Former President of Xiaoximen Hospital]

330
19:48.000 --> 19:49.350
The diastolic pressure is over 90. Good.

331
19:49.350 --> 19:50.510
Do you exercise usually?

332
19:50.510 --> 19:51.350
Keep it up.

333
19:51.590 --> 19:53.320
And pay attention to your diet.

334
19:54.480 --> 19:56.590
I had been working as an administrator for so long.

335
19:56.590 --> 19:58.480
I've almost forgotten I'm a doctor.

336
19:58.480 --> 19:59.510
You've never been

337
19:59.590 --> 20:00.880
a doctor in my heart.

338
20:02.160 --> 20:04.420
You were born to be a hospital president.

339
20:04.720 --> 20:05.830
You have that kind

340
20:05.830 --> 20:06.960
of leadership charisma.

341
20:06.670 --> 20:08.690
[Former President of Xiaoximen Hospital]

342
20:07.960 --> 20:08.830
I feel very sad

343
20:08.830 --> 20:10.110
hearing you say that.

344
20:09.700 --> 20:11.290
[Former President of Xiaoximen Hospital]

345
20:10.480 --> 20:11.720
What's there to be sad about?

346
20:11.720 --> 20:13.110
You don't even want to be a leader,

347
20:13.110 --> 20:13.640
do you?

348
20:13.920 --> 20:15.580
Doctor, I feel a little dizzy.

349
20:15.590 --> 20:16.850
You are the President?

350
20:17.110 --> 20:18.170
Former President.

351
20:18.750 --> 20:19.720
What do you mean?

352
20:20.110 --> 20:21.640
Aren't you President Long?

353
20:24.790 --> 20:25.680
I used to be the President,

354
20:25.680 --> 20:26.720
but not anymore.

355
20:27.160 --> 20:29.160
Then do your words carry weight now?

356
20:29.750 --> 20:31.270
Well, that depends.

357
20:32.400 --> 20:33.070
I want you

358
20:33.070 --> 20:34.550
to arrange a job for my son.

359
20:34.790 --> 20:35.640
Can you do it?

360
20:37.000 --> 20:39.000
What kind of job does your son want?

361
20:39.720 --> 20:40.880
We don't have high expectations.

362
20:40.880 --> 20:42.350
A permanent position is fine.

363
20:42.350 --> 20:44.610
The workplace is preferably in the city.

364
20:45.830 --> 20:46.750
If I could find

365
20:46.750 --> 20:47.720
a job like that,

366
20:48.160 --> 20:49.690
I wouldn't be sitting here.

367
20:50.110 --> 20:51.000
No way.

368
20:51.550 --> 20:52.270
Then you're just

369
20:52.270 --> 20:53.550
an average president.

370
20:55.270 --> 20:56.880
Just... Just use this prescription

371
20:55.340 --> 20:58.830
[Former President of Xiaoximen Hospital]

372
20:56.920 --> 20:58.250
to improve your health.

373
20:58.270 --> 20:59.000
Okay.

374
21:01.350 --> 21:02.160
Mr. Long.

375
21:03.590 --> 21:04.480
Huang.

376
21:05.680 --> 21:07.030
I heard you guys are doing a free clinic here.

377
21:07.030 --> 21:08.590
I bought some walnut cookies on my way here,

378
21:08.590 --> 21:10.720
so you can grab a bite if you're hungry.

379
21:12.550 --> 21:13.240
Nice.

380
21:13.550 --> 21:15.810
There happens to be no one here right now.

381
21:15.830 --> 21:16.790
Are you available?

382
21:16.790 --> 21:17.680
I have no patients here.

383
21:17.680 --> 21:19.210
But the two of them are busy.

384
21:19.880 --> 21:21.920
Can you take some time to check on Liu Zhengliang?

385
21:21.920 --> 21:22.720
What's wrong?

386
21:22.720 --> 21:23.680
He's sick.

387
21:23.680 --> 21:26.140
I'm afraid he might take a turn for the worse.

388
21:26.280 --> 21:28.160
[Former President of Xiaoximen Hospital]

389
21:32.270 --> 21:33.200
Liu Zhengliang.

390
21:33.790 --> 21:34.720
Liu Zhengliang.

391
21:34.790 --> 21:35.720
Liu Zhengliang.

392
21:42.070 --> 21:43.330
What's wrong with you?

393
21:44.880 --> 21:45.720
Pay up.

394
21:45.830 --> 21:46.760
You lost the bet.

395
21:47.750 --> 21:48.550
You're awake?

396
21:49.750 --> 21:51.010
Have some fruit, guys.

397
21:51.480 --> 21:52.550
I admit defeat.

398
21:54.590 --> 21:55.650
What are you doing?

399
21:55.880 --> 21:57.810
-They just made a bet -Impressive.

400
21:57.960 --> 21:59.030
and guessed what your first words

401
21:59.030 --> 22:00.200
would be after waking up.

402
22:00.200 --> 22:01.640
President Long... won?

403
22:01.790 --> 22:02.720
Then you must have said,

404
22:02.720 --> 22:04.120
"What's wrong with you?"

405
22:04.400 --> 22:05.160
I originally guessed

406
22:05.160 --> 22:06.030
that your first words

407
22:06.030 --> 22:07.640
would definitely be swearing.

408
22:07.640 --> 22:09.270
That was way off.

409
22:09.270 --> 22:10.830
He's a gentleman.

410
22:10.830 --> 22:11.960
How could he possibly swear?

411
22:11.960 --> 22:12.960
I guessed that

412
22:12.960 --> 22:14.760
you would jump up with a big yelp.

413
22:20.440 --> 22:23.440
I think there's really something wrong with you guys.

414
22:24.510 --> 22:25.710
I didn't want to come.

415
22:26.960 --> 22:28.690
Ai Chen said you had a high fever

416
22:28.720 --> 22:30.590
and forced us to come and check on you.

417
22:30.590 --> 22:32.520
Let me see if you're having a fever.

418
22:33.680 --> 22:35.480
There seems to be a slight fever.

419
22:36.640 --> 22:37.590
Are you done checking?

420
22:37.590 --> 22:38.440
Leave now if you are done.

421
22:38.440 --> 22:39.680
I still need to rest.

422
22:40.400 --> 22:41.200
No rush.

423
22:41.790 --> 22:43.070
You're not cured yet.

424
22:45.240 --> 22:46.110
Even I couldn't cure myself.

425
22:46.110 --> 22:47.310
Can you cure me?

426
22:47.400 --> 22:48.960
Emotional wounds

427
22:49.110 --> 22:51.640
need emotional healing.

428
22:53.270 --> 22:54.440
Even if they can't cure him,

429
22:54.440 --> 22:56.070
at least they can give him

430
22:56.240 --> 22:57.160
some peace of mind.

431
22:57.160 --> 22:58.510
Yes, exactly.

432
23:02.200 --> 23:03.440
Xiaoximen Hospital

433
23:04.240 --> 23:05.720
won't be closed forever.

434
23:06.480 --> 23:07.240
Don't ask me

435
23:07.240 --> 23:07.750
any questions.

436
23:07.750 --> 23:09.680
Don't ask me what method I will use.

437
23:10.750 --> 23:11.550
I can only assure you

438
23:11.550 --> 23:13.080
that I'll have it open soon.

439
23:16.960 --> 23:18.400
You can also continue to work at Xiaoximen

440
23:18.400 --> 23:19.600
for many, many years.

441
23:24.270 --> 23:25.680
How is this good news?

442
23:35.440 --> 23:36.550
I think I

443
23:36.550 --> 23:37.880
promised him before.

444
23:38.790 --> 23:39.440
I promised

445
23:39.440 --> 23:41.570
to give him a room with sealed windows.

446
23:42.440 --> 23:44.370
Now I've decided to add something.

447
23:46.200 --> 23:47.920
He can take days off when it snows,

448
23:47.920 --> 23:48.920
with full pay,

449
23:49.350 --> 23:50.810
and keep the special room.

450
23:51.640 --> 23:53.110
And when it snows,

451
23:53.110 --> 23:53.880
I'll immediately

452
23:53.880 --> 23:55.350
have someone shovel all the snow away.

453
23:55.350 --> 23:56.070
Of course,

454
23:56.350 --> 23:57.880
only inside the hospital.

455
24:01.400 --> 24:02.880
This is the best

456
24:05.070 --> 24:06.110
I can do.

457
24:18.720 --> 24:19.510
That's all?

458
24:19.680 --> 24:20.480
What?

459
24:21.310 --> 24:22.640
Is this not good enough?

460
24:25.110 --> 24:25.920
There's more.

461
24:31.640 --> 24:33.900
I won't force you to get treated anymore.

462
24:36.640 --> 24:37.880
I mean what I say.

463
24:47.030 --> 24:48.030
I want to treat it.

464
24:48.160 --> 24:49.640
Help me get access to the cold storage again.

465
24:49.640 --> 24:51.100
I want to try one more time.

466
24:55.440 --> 24:56.310
He's hopeless.

467
24:58.720 --> 24:59.510
Hopeless.

468
25:01.110 --> 25:01.960
Hopeless.

469
25:05.240 --> 25:06.240
Serves you right.

470
25:15.960 --> 25:17.030
Interesting.

471
25:17.030 --> 25:17.960
Come here, too.

472
25:18.680 --> 25:22.030
You now look more like a local than I do.

473
25:25.240 --> 25:28.100
If there's really no other way, I'll just stay here.

474
25:29.750 --> 25:31.880
What are you laughing at? What do you mean?

475
25:31.880 --> 25:33.110
It's fine by me.

476
25:33.880 --> 25:34.810
But the point is,

477
25:35.160 --> 25:36.830
can you let go of Fucheng?

478
25:37.110 --> 25:38.880
What have I got to lose?

479
25:39.480 --> 25:41.680
I have nothing there but my parents.

480
25:44.110 --> 25:45.270
I don't

481
25:46.510 --> 25:47.440
think so.

482
25:51.400 --> 25:52.330
What do you mean?

483
25:54.640 --> 25:56.160
Last time I went back,

484
25:57.000 --> 25:58.440
we were eating at Mingming's house,

485
25:58.440 --> 26:00.040
and you showed up uninvited.

486
26:00.310 --> 26:01.000
You kept

487
26:01.000 --> 26:02.440
glancing at her.

488
26:03.480 --> 26:04.880
What was that?

489
26:05.960 --> 26:07.220
Do you think I'm a fool?

490
26:08.550 --> 26:09.550
Do you think I couldn't tell

491
26:09.550 --> 26:10.810
your feelings for her?

492
26:16.960 --> 26:17.750
Yes.

493
26:19.440 --> 26:20.900
I do have feelings for her.

494
26:22.720 --> 26:24.110
She's the kind of girl

495
26:25.070 --> 26:26.160
who works hard

496
26:26.640 --> 26:27.840
and tries to get a PhD.

497
26:29.880 --> 26:30.550
Given the way I am,

498
26:30.550 --> 26:32.610
if I were her, I'd look down on me, too.

499
26:34.920 --> 26:36.160
Come on, man,

500
26:37.640 --> 26:39.240
you sound just like I used to.

501
26:39.790 --> 26:40.960
I was also like that.

502
26:41.640 --> 26:42.640
I hated it when she told me

503
26:42.640 --> 26:43.680
what to do,

504
26:44.310 --> 26:45.640
urged me to study,

505
26:45.830 --> 26:47.830
and always tried to keep me in check.

506
26:49.400 --> 26:51.240
Wasn't that all for your own good?

507
26:51.240 --> 26:52.550
She wants a chance to study,

508
26:52.550 --> 26:54.080
but she can't even have one.

509
26:55.030 --> 26:56.070
She just hoped

510
26:57.590 --> 26:58.990
for the people around her

511
27:00.000 --> 27:01.530
to leave no regrets, right?

512
27:09.550 --> 27:10.790
I still

513
27:11.960 --> 27:13.350
owe her an apology.

514
27:15.680 --> 27:16.480
Chen Junnan.

515
27:21.110 --> 27:23.110
I think you know her better than I do.

516
27:51.480 --> 27:52.240
Mingming,

517
27:52.720 --> 27:54.110
has something gone wrong

518
27:54.110 --> 27:55.710
at your workplace recently?

519
27:57.070 --> 27:57.830
Nope.

520
27:57.830 --> 27:58.550
W-What's wrong?

521
27:58.550 --> 27:59.350
What's wrong?

522
28:00.070 --> 28:00.880
Why hasn't

523
28:00.880 --> 28:02.640
Commissioner Chen come lately?

524
28:02.640 --> 28:03.480
Who?

525
28:04.000 --> 28:05.130
Commissioner Chen,

526
28:05.240 --> 28:06.590
the one who came to our place for dinner

527
28:06.590 --> 28:08.190
and brought pizza last time.

528
28:09.400 --> 28:11.800
Commissioner Chen is a brilliant comrade.

529
28:12.400 --> 28:13.350
This comrade

530
28:14.070 --> 28:16.400
has been undercover in the hospital for a long time,

531
28:16.400 --> 28:17.270
making

532
28:17.310 --> 28:19.710
great contributions to the organization.

533
28:19.750 --> 28:21.280
But what is he busy with now?

534
28:24.880 --> 28:25.590
Mingming,

535
28:25.590 --> 28:26.720
what is he busy with?

536
28:27.480 --> 28:28.240
Mingming?

537
28:29.720 --> 28:30.640
How do I know

538
28:30.640 --> 28:31.880
what he's busy with?

539
28:32.070 --> 28:33.640
You are colleagues in the same workplace!

540
28:33.640 --> 28:34.440
How could you not know

541
28:34.440 --> 28:35.640
what he's been doing?

542
28:39.590 --> 28:40.680
I got it.

543
28:42.640 --> 28:44.000
I probably have been abandoned

544
28:44.000 --> 28:45.480
by the organization.

545
28:45.830 --> 28:47.750
I feel very uneasy.

546
28:49.400 --> 28:50.350
You'd better ask him

547
28:50.350 --> 28:51.310
what's going on.

548
29:01.960 --> 29:02.750
It works!

549
29:03.480 --> 29:06.210
The signal's much better today than two days ago.

550
29:10.430 --> 29:11.760
[Xiaoximen is closed down.]

551
29:11.780 --> 29:13.300
[Are you not going to come back?]

552
29:24.030 --> 29:24.830
Hello?

553
29:27.030 --> 29:27.790
It's me.

554
29:30.270 --> 29:31.930
It's really hard to reach you.

555
29:32.110 --> 29:34.310
I thought you were taken away by aliens.

556
29:36.270 --> 29:37.400
Well, um,

557
29:38.000 --> 29:40.640
the signal here is intermittent.

558
29:43.550 --> 29:44.790
H-How are you doing?

559
29:47.310 --> 29:48.570
I'm doing pretty fine.

560
30:02.350 --> 30:03.680
Is there anything else?

561
30:08.240 --> 30:09.070
Well,

562
30:09.350 --> 30:10.270
Zhengliang's been

563
30:10.270 --> 30:11.800
having a rough time lately.

564
30:14.960 --> 30:15.790
What's wrong?

565
30:16.510 --> 30:18.720
He's treating his chionophobia.

566
30:19.000 --> 30:20.400
He's been having a fever.

567
30:24.680 --> 30:25.590
I see.

568
30:28.960 --> 30:30.510
That's all. I'll hang up.

569
30:31.070 --> 30:31.880
Bye.

570
30:45.880 --> 30:47.790
You've been here for so long.

571
30:47.960 --> 30:49.640
I only taught you how to work

572
30:49.790 --> 30:51.590
but didn't teach you any skills.

573
30:53.680 --> 30:54.480
You were teaching me skills

574
30:54.480 --> 30:56.410
when you told me how to work, right?

575
30:57.270 --> 30:59.270
Our ethnic minorities in the Greater Khingan Mountains

576
30:59.270 --> 31:00.240
have a song we often sing.

577
31:00.240 --> 31:01.270
I'll teach you.

578
31:01.750 --> 31:02.550
Okay.

579
31:02.790 --> 31:03.790
When you leave in the future,

580
31:03.790 --> 31:04.990
you can brag about it.

581
31:05.270 --> 31:06.880
It's not a wasted trip, right?

582
31:06.880 --> 31:08.740
I'll sing it to them when I go back.

583
31:09.790 --> 31:11.030
Sing after me.

584
31:12.240 --> 31:14.830
There's a vast forest

585
31:14.920 --> 31:17.110
in the Greater Khingan Mountains.

586
31:19.270 --> 31:21.790
There's a vast forest

587
31:21.880 --> 31:24.070
in the Greater Khingan Mountains.

588
31:24.510 --> 31:26.960
In the forest live

589
31:27.000 --> 31:29.160
the brave Oroqen people.

590
31:29.590 --> 31:32.000
In the forest live

591
31:32.110 --> 31:34.160
the brave Oroqen people.

592
31:34.550 --> 31:37.030
A sturdy steed

593
31:37.070 --> 31:38.880
and a gun.

594
31:39.480 --> 31:41.790
A sturdy steed

595
31:41.960 --> 31:43.960
and a gun.

596
31:44.400 --> 31:46.590
There's a vast forest

597
31:46.590 --> 31:48.270
in the Greater Khingan Mountains.

598
31:48.880 --> 31:51.030
In the forest live

599
31:51.070 --> 31:52.790
the brave Oroqen people.

600
31:53.240 --> 31:55.310
A sturdy steed

601
31:55.350 --> 31:57.160
and a gun.

602
31:57.480 --> 31:59.590
The mountains abound with all kinds of deer,

603
31:59.590 --> 32:01.240
more than you could ever count.

604
32:09.480 --> 32:11.240
You don't have to take such good care of me.

605
32:11.240 --> 32:13.100
It's not like I'm terminally ill.

606
32:14.480 --> 32:16.480
You're really feeling better, huh?

607
32:17.440 --> 32:18.240
Listen.

608
32:19.550 --> 32:20.920
I'll do whatever I want.

609
32:20.960 --> 32:21.830
Leave me alone.

610
32:24.110 --> 32:25.790
Stop wasting your time on me.

611
32:25.960 --> 32:27.760
Pay more attention to yourself.

612
32:29.000 --> 32:30.880
What do you mean by that?

613
32:33.350 --> 32:35.280
Do something that makes you happy.

614
32:36.590 --> 32:37.720
Then I did it right.

615
32:37.720 --> 32:39.180
I'm super happy right now.

616
32:43.240 --> 32:43.880
At least

617
32:43.880 --> 32:45.240
don't delay your work.

618
32:45.880 --> 32:47.590
I heard you declined several orders.

619
32:47.590 --> 32:48.350
Is that true?

620
32:49.880 --> 32:51.740
Can you stop listening to rumors?

621
32:52.440 --> 32:53.590
When did I ever delay my work?

622
32:53.590 --> 32:54.070
I...

623
32:54.400 --> 32:56.660
I do my work all in the middle of the night.

624
32:56.790 --> 32:58.440
It's just a few less hours of sleep.

625
32:58.440 --> 32:59.200
No big deal.

626
33:03.790 --> 33:04.590
You know what?

627
33:05.350 --> 33:06.400
Just because you've

628
33:06.400 --> 33:08.030
got a few more years of schooling

629
33:08.030 --> 33:09.720
doesn't mean you can lecture me.

630
33:09.720 --> 33:11.320
Do you think I'm an imbecile?

631
33:12.310 --> 33:13.570
People are different.

632
33:14.400 --> 33:15.110
Not everyone

633
33:15.110 --> 33:16.750
puts money first,

634
33:16.750 --> 33:17.510
you know?

635
33:18.350 --> 33:19.160
What?

636
33:19.510 --> 33:20.910
Is going out to work hard,

637
33:21.960 --> 33:22.790
having whatever

638
33:22.790 --> 33:23.920
you want,

639
33:23.920 --> 33:25.200
and wearing pretty clothes

640
33:25.200 --> 33:27.060
the only way to satisfy yourself?

641
33:27.640 --> 33:28.440
Nope.

642
33:29.350 --> 33:30.510
Treating you well

643
33:31.310 --> 33:32.470
just makes me happy,

644
33:32.880 --> 33:33.940
and that's enough.

645
33:35.070 --> 33:36.270
What else do you want?

646
33:38.830 --> 33:40.200
What else can I ask for?

647
33:41.350 --> 33:42.310
You don't know?

648
33:42.310 --> 33:43.680
Let me tell you.

649
33:45.270 --> 33:47.070
When you get along with someone,

650
33:47.510 --> 33:48.310
treating them well

651
33:48.310 --> 33:49.790
is not about causing them

652
33:49.790 --> 33:51.000
less trouble.

653
33:51.270 --> 33:52.070
No.

654
33:52.750 --> 33:54.790
It's about being sincere.

655
33:56.270 --> 33:57.110
It means that

656
33:57.640 --> 33:59.000
you should share

657
33:59.880 --> 34:01.110
good news with me

658
34:01.590 --> 34:03.030
and ask for help

659
34:03.440 --> 34:04.770
when you're in trouble.

660
34:04.790 --> 34:06.510
Right? That's treating others well.

661
34:06.510 --> 34:07.830
Instead of worrying over nothing,

662
34:07.830 --> 34:08.489
it's better

663
34:09.150 --> 34:11.030
to have some barbecue together.

664
34:12.030 --> 34:13.030
Isn't that great?

665
34:17.000 --> 34:17.760
I don't understand

666
34:17.760 --> 34:18.710
your gibberish.

667
34:19.800 --> 34:21.130
I'm almost done eating.

668
34:21.510 --> 34:22.710
I'm going to lie down.

669
34:23.800 --> 34:25.530
You're going to lie down again?

670
34:26.030 --> 34:26.800
Stop,

671
34:26.840 --> 34:28.230
let's go for a walk.

672
34:29.190 --> 34:30.800
Let's get some fresh air.

673
34:32.280 --> 34:33.880
There's nowhere I want to go.

674
34:34.360 --> 34:36.400
Let's go to the train station, shall we?

675
34:36.400 --> 34:37.929
Why go to the train station?

676
34:38.840 --> 34:40.440
Go with me to pick up a friend.

677
34:41.949 --> 34:45.340
[Welcome to Fucheng Station]

678
34:47.550 --> 34:48.510
Still cold, right?

679
34:48.510 --> 34:49.360
Come this way.

680
34:49.480 --> 34:50.080
It's fine.

681
34:50.550 --> 34:51.550
Here, put this on.

682
34:52.710 --> 34:53.710
What are you doing?

683
34:53.710 --> 34:54.440
No need.

684
34:54.440 --> 34:55.230
Shut up.

685
34:56.880 --> 34:58.140
How dare you pull away?

686
35:03.110 --> 35:04.310
You look really good.

687
35:09.670 --> 35:10.710
You look good!

688
35:10.710 --> 35:11.510
How annoying.

689
35:12.280 --> 35:14.230
You look really good now.

690
35:14.230 --> 35:15.000
Handsome!

691
35:15.000 --> 35:16.110
Absolutely!

692
35:16.230 --> 35:17.150
What did you do?

693
35:17.150 --> 35:18.000
Look...

694
35:18.000 --> 35:19.150
Why is your face all chapped?

695
35:19.150 --> 35:20.070
What happened?

696
35:20.110 --> 35:21.070
I've gone to play with deer

697
35:21.070 --> 35:22.440
in the Greater Khingan Mountains, right?

698
35:22.440 --> 35:23.230
Reindeer!

699
35:23.280 --> 35:24.440
It had worms in its stomach.

700
35:24.440 --> 35:25.440
I smoked it,

701
35:25.440 --> 35:26.480
and it turned me into this.

702
35:26.480 --> 35:28.320
Did you smoke the deer or yourself?

703
35:28.320 --> 35:30.150
There's a vast forest

704
35:30.150 --> 35:31.760
in the Greater Khingan Mountains.

705
35:31.880 --> 35:33.920
In the forest live

706
35:33.920 --> 35:35.630
the brave Oroqen people.

707
35:36.030 --> 35:38.030
A sturdy steed

708
35:38.150 --> 35:39.560
and a gun.

709
35:40.000 --> 35:41.880
The mountains abound with all kinds of deer,

710
35:41.880 --> 35:43.320
too many to eliminate.

711
35:43.760 --> 35:44.710
Everyone's looking at you.

712
35:44.710 --> 35:45.440
Enough.

713
35:45.960 --> 35:47.220
It's good you're back.

714
35:48.550 --> 35:50.080
It's good you didn't leave.

715
35:51.960 --> 35:53.690
I'll teach you throat singing.

716
36:01.760 --> 36:02.590
I heard from Mingming

717
36:01.850 --> 36:06.460
[Vacant]

718
36:02.590 --> 36:04.550
that you've had a persistent fever lately.

719
36:04.550 --> 36:05.480
What's going on?

720
36:06.760 --> 36:08.690
It's alright. I've recovered now.

721
36:08.760 --> 36:09.620
Say that again.

722
36:10.710 --> 36:11.590
I took your temperature

723
36:11.590 --> 36:13.800
this morning, and it was still 37.8 degrees.

724
36:13.800 --> 36:15.360
This constant low fever is no good.

725
36:15.360 --> 36:16.710
Is it a virus, or an infection,

726
36:16.710 --> 36:17.480
or what?

727
36:17.480 --> 36:18.760
Don't burn your lungs out.

728
36:18.760 --> 36:20.150
Alright, enough about me.

729
36:20.150 --> 36:21.350
Let's talk about you.

730
36:21.590 --> 36:22.720
What are your plans?

731
36:22.960 --> 36:24.960
Are you going back to No. 1 Hospital?

732
36:26.280 --> 36:27.320
Now that I'm back after being away

733
36:27.320 --> 36:28.510
for days, I definitely have to handle

734
36:28.510 --> 36:29.910
the urgent things first.

735
36:30.710 --> 36:32.510
There is something urgent here.

736
36:32.750 --> 36:34.190
Persuade your buddy

737
36:34.320 --> 36:35.580
not to push his limits.

738
36:36.480 --> 36:37.740
What? What do you mean?

739
36:39.440 --> 36:41.440
Do you know about exposure therapy?

740
36:41.840 --> 36:44.230
It's about locking him in a cold storage

741
36:44.760 --> 36:46.760
and forcing him to face ice and snow.

742
36:48.480 --> 36:50.080
Isn't that suicide therapy?

743
36:50.590 --> 36:52.520
Is it the reason why you got a fever?

744
36:55.710 --> 36:56.710
Whose idea was it?

745
36:58.840 --> 36:59.630
Mine.

746
37:00.150 --> 37:01.480
But I've changed my mind now.

747
37:01.480 --> 37:02.590
I can't bear

748
37:02.590 --> 37:03.920
to see him in this state.

749
37:04.630 --> 37:05.960
You can't bear to see it?

750
37:06.230 --> 37:07.560
What did you say before?

751
37:07.800 --> 37:08.840
That was before.

752
37:08.960 --> 37:10.440
I've changed my mind now.

753
37:11.070 --> 37:12.190
Women are fickle,

754
37:12.190 --> 37:13.030
you know?

755
37:14.030 --> 37:16.030
Let's not force anything, okay?

756
37:18.070 --> 37:19.530
Wait, let me sort this out.

757
37:20.110 --> 37:21.440
So basically,

758
37:22.190 --> 37:24.590
he wants to continue to stimulate himself.

759
37:26.000 --> 37:27.330
Ai Chen feels bad for you

760
37:27.550 --> 37:29.440
and doesn't want you to continue,

761
37:29.440 --> 37:30.150
right?

762
37:31.880 --> 37:32.710
That's pretty much it.

763
37:32.710 --> 37:34.320
What do you mean, pretty much?

764
37:34.320 --> 37:36.000
When did I feel bad for you?

765
37:37.070 --> 37:38.670
A-Am I that sentimental?

766
37:39.480 --> 37:40.800
I'm afraid this might wear him out.

767
37:40.800 --> 37:42.230
What if his illness gets worse?

768
37:42.230 --> 37:43.290
Yes, I understand.

769
37:43.400 --> 37:45.280
But I still support Dr. Liu.

770
37:45.920 --> 37:47.180
If it doesn't kill him,

771
37:48.110 --> 37:49.840
just treat him to death, right?

772
37:50.960 --> 37:52.400
But come to think of it,

773
37:52.630 --> 37:53.440
if I die,

774
37:53.440 --> 37:54.500
what should you do?

775
37:55.550 --> 37:56.800
That's quite convenient.

776
37:56.800 --> 37:57.920
Her whole family can send you off.

777
37:57.920 --> 37:59.050
A one-stop service.

778
38:00.000 --> 38:00.860
Say that again!

779
38:00.960 --> 38:02.000
You're so annoying, aren't you?

780
38:02.000 --> 38:03.460
But that's true, isn't it?

781
38:05.320 --> 38:06.710
But listen,

782
38:08.000 --> 38:09.400
I'm serious this time.

783
38:21.710 --> 38:23.030
Ai, you're back?

784
38:32.510 --> 38:33.320
Ai Chen.

785
38:34.960 --> 38:35.760
Ai Chen...

786
38:52.840 --> 38:54.370
Isn't this Ai Chen's scarf?

787
38:54.760 --> 38:56.440
Why is it around your neck?

788
38:58.500 --> 39:02.740
[Gas Safety Reminder: Gas safety concerns every household.]

789
38:59.070 --> 39:00.280
She lent it to me.

790
39:00.710 --> 39:01.440
You can just

791
39:01.440 --> 39:02.110
take it back to her.

792
39:02.110 --> 39:02.880
No need.

793
39:02.920 --> 39:03.710
Keep it on.

794
39:05.030 --> 39:06.160
It looks good on you.

795
39:08.440 --> 39:09.590
Let's talk inside,

796
39:09.590 --> 39:10.150
Mrs. Mi Si.

797
39:10.150 --> 39:10.840
Come on.

798
39:20.150 --> 39:22.010
I'm more familiar with this house

799
39:22.150 --> 39:23.190
than you are.

800
39:24.960 --> 39:27.020
I used to come here often when your mom

801
39:27.320 --> 39:28.190
was alive.

802
39:31.480 --> 39:32.840
Whenever she got sick,

803
39:34.190 --> 39:35.920
I was the one taking care of her.

804
39:39.030 --> 39:40.000
I don't seem

805
39:40.000 --> 39:41.030
to have any memory

806
39:41.030 --> 39:42.440
of seeing my mom sick.

807
39:45.070 --> 39:46.670
Maybe I saw it when I was a kid,

808
39:47.030 --> 39:48.190
but it's been so long

809
39:48.190 --> 39:49.450
that I don't remember.

810
39:50.630 --> 39:51.590
So I always thought

811
39:51.590 --> 39:53.070
my mom was in good health.

812
39:55.760 --> 39:57.560
Being a doctor for so many years,

813
39:58.800 --> 39:59.670
I never asked her

814
39:59.670 --> 40:00.670
about her health.

815
40:02.670 --> 40:03.600
Do you regret it?

816
40:09.230 --> 40:10.030
Your mom

817
40:11.000 --> 40:13.400
always shared the good news, never the bad.

818
40:14.280 --> 40:16.080
She kept her troubles to herself

819
40:16.400 --> 40:18.330
and never wanted to bother others.

820
40:19.510 --> 40:20.510
But she was

821
40:20.840 --> 40:21.590
very sensitive,

822
40:21.590 --> 40:24.070
fragile, and kind.

823
40:27.070 --> 40:28.330
Are you also like that?

824
40:33.150 --> 40:34.030
I don't know.

825
40:36.670 --> 40:37.550
Do you know that your mom

826
40:37.550 --> 40:39.550
visited your dad's grave every year

827
40:39.840 --> 40:41.300
and stayed at the cemetery

828
40:41.440 --> 40:43.110
for a whole day each time?

829
40:45.360 --> 40:46.150
No, I don't.

830
40:48.030 --> 40:48.760
Then do you know

831
40:48.760 --> 40:50.440
why I came to see you today?

832
41:02.400 --> 41:03.190
Look.

833
41:04.110 --> 41:05.800
I used your treatment method

834
41:06.110 --> 41:08.770
and snapped myself with a rubber band all night.

835
41:14.550 --> 41:15.550
For the first time

836
41:16.630 --> 41:18.830
in so many years, I've admitted I'm sick

837
41:19.550 --> 41:21.590
and been willing to get treated.

838
41:23.440 --> 41:24.920
It's not for myself,

839
41:25.280 --> 41:26.440
but for you

840
41:26.480 --> 41:27.400
and Ai Chen.

841
41:28.760 --> 41:29.800
Seeing Ai Chen

842
41:30.280 --> 41:32.280
worry so much about your treatment,

843
41:33.590 --> 41:34.960
I wanted to do something

844
41:34.960 --> 41:35.840
to help her.

845
41:37.000 --> 41:39.130
I just wanted to set an example for you.

846
41:40.230 --> 41:41.840
If I can be cured,

847
41:42.320 --> 41:44.450
then you definitely can be cured, too.

848
41:48.280 --> 41:49.280
If you get better,

849
41:50.630 --> 41:51.830
Ai Chen will be happy,

850
41:53.510 --> 41:55.070
and I can rest easy, too.

851
42:07.630 --> 42:09.890
But the moment I stepped into this house,

852
42:10.070 --> 42:11.630
I thought of your mom.

853
42:13.670 --> 42:15.630
Seeing you looking so sickly

854
42:16.880 --> 42:18.540
reminded me of your mom saying

855
42:18.880 --> 42:20.280
how much she loved you,

856
42:21.230 --> 42:23.290
worried about you, and cared for you.

857
42:26.110 --> 42:27.710
I couldn't bear to force you.

858
42:29.510 --> 42:30.670
So I changed my mind.

859
42:40.550 --> 42:41.360
Zhengliang.

860
42:43.510 --> 42:44.970
Let's stop the treatment.

861
42:46.550 --> 42:47.880
Some scars

862
42:48.230 --> 42:49.590
just can't heal.

863
42:50.670 --> 42:51.670
If you can move on,

864
42:52.230 --> 42:53.710
there's a way to live.

865
42:54.440 --> 42:55.590
If you can't,

866
42:55.800 --> 42:57.800
there's a way to live with that, too.

867
42:59.320 --> 43:00.590
Nothing matters more

868
43:01.710 --> 43:03.190
than life itself.
